      "widgets_values": [
        "\n补充高频并提升清晰度 - Boost high frequencies and enhance clarity\n\nKeyword Matching: The older version strictly checked Chinese keywords (\"带宽\", \"高频\", \"超分辨率\", \"清晰度\", \"补频\").\nSolution\n1. Immediate Workaround (No Server Restart Needed)\nIn Node 3 (AuKGenerateEdit), set Primary Content (text / value / multiplier) to the Chinese text from the note:\n\ntext\n补充高频并提升清晰度\n(You can queue the prompt immediately without restarting ComfyUI).\n\n2. Permanent Fix Applied\nThe node code in \n\ntask_templates.py\n has been updated and verified:\n\nAdded broad English keyword support for Audio Quality Restoration: \"boost\", \"enhance\", \"frequencies\", \"frequency\", \"clarity\", \"bandwidth\", \"quality\", and \"super resolution\".\nIf Primary Content is left blank on this task, it now defaults directly to the standard bandwidth restoration instruction: \"This audio suffers from limited bandwidth. Please restore it to a wideband, clear-sounding speech.\"\nAlso covers English acoustic defects: \"telephone\", \"megaphone\", \"underwater\", \"clipping\", \"dropout\", and \"dc offset\"."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "\n补充高频并提升清晰度 - Boost high frequencies and enhance clarity\n\nKeyword Matching: The older version strictly checked Chinese keywords (\"带宽\", \"高频\", \"超分辨率\", \"清晰度\", \"补频\").\nSolution\n1. Immediate Workaround (No Server Restart Needed)\nIn Node 3 (AuKGenerateEdit), set Primary Content (text / value / multiplier) to the Chinese text from the note:\n\ntext\n补充高频并提升清晰度\n(You can queue the prompt immediately without restarting ComfyUI).\n\n2. Permanent Fix Applied\nThe node code in \n\ntask_templates.py\n has been updated and verified:\n\nAdded broad English keyword support for Audio Quality Restoration: \"boost\", \"enhance\", \"frequencies\", \"frequency\", \"clarity\", \"bandwidth\", \"quality\", and \"super resolution\".\nIf Primary Content is left blank on this task, it now defaults directly to the standard bandwidth restoration instruction: \"This audio suffers from limited bandwidth. Please restore it to a wideband, clear-sounding speech.\"\nAlso covers English acoustic defects: \"telephone\", \"megaphone\", \"underwater\", \"clipping\", \"dropout\", and \"dc offset\"."
      },
